1
00:00:00,156 --> 00:00:00,849
Namaste!

2
00:00:00,849 --> 00:00:04,484
Medoro Distribution mein aapka swagat hai.

3
00:00:04,484 --> 00:00:10,631
Aaj hum Medoro Distribution software ka complete product tour dekhenge,

4
00:00:10,631 --> 00:00:15,392
ek demo distributor ke saath, poore fictional data par.

5
00:00:16,343 --> 00:00:21,643
Agar aap pharmaceutical distributor, medicine wholesaler, stockist,

6
00:00:21,643 --> 00:00:28,840
super stockist ya C and F agent hain, toh aap jaante hain ki orders, stock, chemist credit,

7
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:34,219
GST billing aur payment collection sambhalna kitna mushkil hota hai.

8
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:40,679
Medoro Distribution ek pharma wholesale aur distribution ERP hai.

9
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:48,262
Matlab ek hi software jisme orders, godown ka stock, invoices, dispatch, collections,

10
00:00:48,262 --> 00:00:52,276
accounts aur GST, sab ek saath jude hue hain.

11
00:00:52,939 --> 00:00:59,489
Website par dekhiye: yeh software pharma distributors, wholesalers, stockists,

12
00:00:59,489 --> 00:01:03,855
super stockists aur C and F agents ke liye bana hai.

13
00:01:04,527 --> 00:01:09,946
Retail pharmacy aur wholesale distribution mein bada fark hai.

14
00:01:09,946 --> 00:01:13,529
Pharmacy ek grahak ko MRP par bechti hai.

15
00:01:13,529 --> 00:01:19,560
Distributor chemists ko PTR ya PTS par, udhaar par, schemes ke saath,

16
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:22,619
aur kai godowns se maal bhejta hai.

17
00:01:23,317 --> 00:01:27,683
Distribution business mein paisa chupke se kahan jaata hai?

18
00:01:27,683 --> 00:01:33,232
Udhaar jo badhta rehta hai, near-expiry maal jiska claim time par nahi hua,

19
00:01:33,232 --> 00:01:39,743
haath se calculate ki gayi schemes, aur phone ya WhatsApp par aaye orders jo dobara type

20
00:01:39,743 --> 00:01:41,001
karne padte hain.

21
00:01:41,701 --> 00:01:47,587
Medoro inhi samasyaon ko seedha pakadta hai: har order par credit check,

22
00:01:47,587 --> 00:01:54,699
batch-wise stock reservation, automatic schemes, wholesale GST invoice, mobile picking,

23
00:01:54,699 --> 00:01:57,969
dispatch, expiry claims aur collections.

24
00:01:58,665 --> 00:02:01,648
Order se paise tak ek seedhi line hai.

25
00:02:01,648 --> 00:02:06,121
Order aata hai, credit check hota hai, invoice banta hai,

26
00:02:06,121 --> 00:02:12,008
godown mein pick aur pack hota hai, dispatch hota hai, aur phir collection.

27
00:02:12,008 --> 00:02:19,229
Har step pichhle step ko check karta hai, isliye stock, invoice aur dues hamesha milte hain.

28
00:02:19,893 --> 00:02:22,456
Ab chaliye software ke andar.

29
00:02:22,456 --> 00:02:30,143
Yeh hai hamare demo distributor, Medoro Demo Pharma Distributors, Ranchi, ka dashboard.

30
00:02:30,143 --> 00:02:34,385
Ismein do mahine ka fictional business data hai.

31
00:02:35,075 --> 00:02:41,714
Ek hi screen par aaj ki sales, mahine ki sales, aaj ka collection, kul receivable,

32
00:02:41,714 --> 00:02:46,247
order pipeline aur top outstanding chemists dikhte hain.

33
00:02:46,247 --> 00:02:51,024
Left side ke menu mein Sales, Warehouse, Purchase, Finance,

34
00:02:51,024 --> 00:02:54,343
Masters aur System ke saare modules hain.

35
00:02:55,029 --> 00:03:02,499
Is training mein hum 26 parts mein, account banane se lekar purchase, GRN, inventory,

36
00:03:02,499 --> 00:03:08,651
orders, credit control, GST invoicing, picking, dispatch, collections,

37
00:03:08,651 --> 00:03:13,924
reports aur security tak, har workflow practically dekhenge.

38
00:03:13,924 --> 00:03:16,121
Chaliye shuru karte hain.

39
00:03:17,653 --> 00:03:22,274
Part 4 mein Distributor dashboard ko detail mein samjhenge.

40
00:03:22,274 --> 00:03:29,322
Har card kya batata hai, aur owner ek hi screen se poore business ki position kaise samajh

41
00:03:29,322 --> 00:03:30,105
sakta hai.

42
00:03:31,063 --> 00:03:34,674
Login karte hi owner yahi screen dekhta hai.

43
00:03:34,674 --> 00:03:40,583
Upar business ka naam, aaj ki date aur abhi chuna hua godown dikhta hai.

44
00:03:40,583 --> 00:03:45,507
Godown badalne ke liye upar wala godown selector use kariye.

45
00:03:46,189 --> 00:03:52,283
Pehla card hai Sales today: aaj ke invoices ki kul value aur unki ginti.

46
00:03:52,283 --> 00:03:57,531
Doosra card Sales this month, saath mein gross margin percent,

47
00:03:57,531 --> 00:04:01,425
yaani maal ki landed cost ke baad kitna bacha.

48
00:04:02,197 --> 00:04:10,331
Teesra card Collected today: aaj chemists se kitna paisa aaya, cash, UPI, NEFT ya cheque mein.

49
00:04:10,331 --> 00:04:15,349
Chautha card Receivable: market mein kul kitna udhaar hai,

50
00:04:15,349 --> 00:04:18,897
aur usmein se kitna overdue ho chuka hai.

51
00:04:19,593 --> 00:04:24,329
Sales, last 30 days chart har din ki sales dikhata hai,

52
00:04:24,329 --> 00:04:28,548
GST ke saath aur cancelled invoices ko chhod kar.

53
00:04:28,548 --> 00:04:34,661
Isse trend turant samajh aata hai: kaunse din kam bikri hui, kab badhi.

54
00:04:35,347 --> 00:04:38,146
Order pipeline sabse kaam ka hissa hai.

55
00:04:38,146 --> 00:04:43,171
Kitne orders approval ka intezaar kar rahe hain, kitne pick hone hain,

56
00:04:43,171 --> 00:04:48,627
kitne pick ho rahe hain, kitne pack hokar invoice ka intezaar kar rahe hain,

57
00:04:48,627 --> 00:04:52,431
kitne dispatch hone hain, aur kitne raaste mein hain.

58
00:04:53,130 --> 00:04:57,959
Neeche do alerts hain: 90 din mein expire hone wale batches,

59
00:04:57,959 --> 00:05:01,339
aur reorder level se neeche gaye products.

60
00:05:01,339 --> 00:05:05,846
Inpar click karke seedha us list par pahunch jaate hain.

61
00:05:06,522 --> 00:05:13,436
Top outstanding mein sabse zyada udhaar wale chemists hain: balance, overdue,

62
00:05:13,436 --> 00:05:19,272
sabse purana bill kitne din ka hai, aur risk low, medium ya high.

63
00:05:19,272 --> 00:05:26,006
Ageing card batata hai ki udhaar 0 se 30 din, 31 se 60, ya usse purana hai.

64
00:05:26,695 --> 00:05:32,886
Kisi chemist ke naam par click karte hi uski profile khulti hai, jahan statement,

65
00:05:32,886 --> 00:05:35,637
credit terms aur special rates hain.

66
00:05:35,637 --> 00:05:39,459
Is tarah dashboard se seedha action le sakte hain.

67
00:05:40,167 --> 00:05:43,154
Upar ghanti mein notifications aate hain,

68
00:05:43,154 --> 00:05:49,347
aur Insights button business intelligence kholta hai, jise hum Part 22 mein dekhenge.

69
00:05:49,347 --> 00:05:54,155
Bill a chemist search se kahin se bhi naya invoice shuru hota hai.

70
00:05:54,870 --> 00:06:00,951
Toh dashboard owner ko subah ki pehli nazar mein batata hai: bikri kaisi hai,

71
00:06:00,951 --> 00:06:06,638
paisa kitna aaya, kitna baaki hai, aur godown mein kaunsa kaam atka hai.

72
00:06:06,638 --> 00:06:10,034
Agle part mein product catalogue banayenge.
